message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "shroom: Spherical Harmonics Room"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for simulating room acoustics using Spherical Harmonics
  (Ambisonics). It provides tools for simulating room impulse responses (ARIR),
  spherical microphone arrays, and binaural rendering.
